[I] Curated list of recommended GNOME applications

[T] gnome-app-list delivers app recommendation data for the GNOME project as
[T] AppStream metadata, installed in the standard system location so it can be
[T] maintained separately from gnome-software itself.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-app-list

[A] The GNOME Project <gnome-devel-list@gnome.org>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/desktop/gnome

